SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Alistair Ogden
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:One of Canada’s top comedic talents\, Alistair first appeared
  in the national spotlight when he won CBC’s Next Up Competition at age 2
 3. Since then\, he’s brought his trademark witty and self-deprecating sty
 le of stand-up to televised sets for Canada’s Got Talent\, the Halifax Co
 medy Festival\, and CBC’s New Wave of Stand Up. In the past year\, he rel
 eased his debut half-hour special Alistair Ogden Does His Best\, recorded a
  set for Don’t Tell Comedy\, sold out shows across the country\, includin
 g a headline hour at Just For Laughs: Vancouver\, and opened for Pete Holme
 s\, Hassan Phills\, Danae Hayes\, and Emma Willmann. His jokes have been fe
 atured on CBC Radio’s Laugh Out Loud\, a Just For Laughs Originals comedy
  album\, and have amassed over 20 million views and rising across Instagram
 \, TikTok\, and YouTube. Don’t miss your chance to see this up and coming
  star!\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which ca
 n be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: 
 Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the tw
 o-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from 
 entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patron
 s.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room
 -alistair-ogden/
